-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party data

This repository contains derived data from PTB-XL and PTB-XL+ (the demo page
embeds 15 PTB-XL ECG signals and their reports; figures and metrics are
computed from the datasets). These datasets are NOT covered by the MIT license
above; they are distributed by PhysioNet under the Creative Commons Attribution
4.0 International license (CC BY 4.0):

  Wagner P, Strodthoff N, Bousseljot R, Samek W, Schaeffter T. PTB-XL, a large
  publicly available electrocardiography dataset (version 1.0.3). PhysioNet
  (2022). https://doi.org/10.13026/kfzx-aw45

  Strodthoff N, Mehari T, Nagel C, Aston PJ, Sundar A, Graff C, Kanters JK,
  Haverkamp W, Dössel O, Loewe A, Bär M, Schaeffter T. PTB-XL+, a comprehensive
  electrocardiographic feature dataset (version 1.0.1). PhysioNet (2023).
  https://doi.org/10.13026/nqsf-pc74

  Goldberger AL, et al. PhysioBank, PhysioToolkit, and PhysioNet. Circulation
  101(23):e215-e220 (2000).
